
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.034139324 0.032466289 -0.039409878) to (41.013861 40.594518 42.19541)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  4032 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  4032 velocities
  read_data CPU = 0.025 seconds

pair_style      meam
pair_coeff      * * library.meam Al Ti AlTi.meam Ti Al
neighbor        1.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes

timestep        0.001

thermo          1000
thermo_style    custom step temp press pxx pyy pzz pe lx ly lz

# ---- short re-equilibration, 2 ps ----
fix             eq all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 aniso 0.0 0.0 1.0
run             2000
